  "description": "POQMAL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H48 Dy4 F48 N12 Ni2 O27,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a branched tree with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.825-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.27-113.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H54Dy4F48N12Ni2O29.",
